DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260920T170000
SUMMARY:September 20 Tichu Tournament
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Board Games and Bars\n**Join us for the September 20 
 Tichu Tournament. Find a partner and sign up on the Gamers website. Cost i
 s $25/team. Prizes will be awarded.**\n\n**Please note: this is not an eve
 nt for beginners or those just learning to play. We hope to see you there.
 **\n\n**To register:**\n**https://www.gamersgeekery.com/events#!event/2026
 /9/20/tichu-tournament**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/triangle-board-games-and-bars/events/
 316460931/
